Subject: [PWG-Announce] PWG February 2021 Face-to-Face Meeting - Summary
To: pwg-announce@pwg.org <pwg-announce@pwg.org>


Greetings,

The PWG held its *February 2021 Virtual Face-to-Face Meeting*
<https://www.pwg.org/chair/meeting-info/february-2021-virtual.html> on
February 9-11, 2021 via Webex teleconferences. Representatives from Canon,
Google, High North, HP Inc., Konica Minolta, Kyocera Document Solutions,
Lakeside Robotics, Lexmark, Microsoft, Qualcomm, Pharos, Ricoh, TIC, TCS
and Xerox attended the meetings, among others. Attendees reviewed work in
progress, including drafts of a number of in-progress specifications, and
discussed liaisons with partner groups. Click here for a summary of the
proceedings:

*https://www.pwg.org/blog/pwg-february-2021-f2f-summary.html*
<https://www.pwg.org/blog/pwg-february-2021-f2f-summary.html>

Thanks to all who attended! Stay healthy!

Smith

/**
    Smith Kennedy
    Chair, IEEE ISTO Printer Working Group
*/



